WEBVTT

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:14.240
Sorry, Rinne. I used up all your money.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.020
Don't tell me you're living 
in a place like this.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.950
Dad's worried.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:21.750
Dad?

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:27.110
Indeed. I'm the president of limited 
legality company Damashigami Company LLC,

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.630
Rokudou Sabato.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:36.580
For you to become a Damashigami is 
something your mother wants as well.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.180
Mom?

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:42.180
First Rinne Cup
Mom Competition

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:42.810
"First Rinne Cup, Mom Competition."

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:42.680
First Rinne Cup
Mom Competition

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.490
They <i>all</i> want to marry me.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.890
But I love them all, and I can't choose.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:55.010
You're his son, Rinne-kun, 
so we want you to choose.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:55.990
<3.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:00:57.900
You were using my money to lure in women?

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.290
You fiend!

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:03.750
You can make as much money 
as you want as a Damashigami.

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:06.580
Rinne, become heir to the company.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:11.050
It's a trope!

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.810
Relax.

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:16.290
I'm sending them back to the living world.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:17.270
But...

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:22.500
I'm only sending them back after you 
promise to become a Damashigami.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:57.940
The Young President's Induction?!

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:02.450
Young President's Induction
& Engagement Announcement

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.640
Engagement announcement?

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:03.990
Rokudou-kun's?

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:06.160
It's true, Mamiya-san.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:10.170
Rokudou's seriously planning 
to marry those girls.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:18.570
Indeed.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:21.810
He can choose from any of 
those Damashigami girls.

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.840
Rinne was happy to accept.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:25.730
Rokudou-kun was?

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:27.720
Are you sure?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.230
Right, Rinne? You did, right?

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.450
Yup, Dad, I'm getting engaged!

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.980
I love girls! Woohoo!

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:41.490
That's my son.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:42.790
Owie.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:43.990
What are you doing?

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.210
Young President!

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:46.660
Rinne-sama!

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:48.700
Shut up!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:50.290
I'm not getting engaged!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.480
Eh?

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:52.960
Why?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.660
Why not, Rinne?

00:03:55.490 --> 00:04:00.070
What do you not like about 
these cute, pretty girls?

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:00.910
Yeah.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.400
Exactly, Rinne-sama.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.600
I see.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.810
You already like someone, don't you?

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.770
A human girl?

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:14.730
That's...

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:18.090
That aside...

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.240
He's trying to hide it.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.930
He likes human girls.

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.360
He fails at hiding it.

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.490
<i>He hid it?</i>

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:31.160
Rokudou, that wimp.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:38.690
<i>Recommended for those of you troubled 
by a lack of courage and guts.</i>

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:40.750
<i>Relationship Success Pendant!</i>

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:45.940
Surely he would have had the courage 
to confess, if he had this pendant.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:48.390
Look, it's the fake fortune teller's pendant.

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:49.850
He fell for it.

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:51.430
Listen, Dad.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:56.020
I came here to take down Damashigami Company.

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:59.750
Are you sure, Rinne?

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:04.660
To take down the company means to defeat me.

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:09.380
Look! It's the president's secret weapon,
the Blood-sucking Fire Wheel!

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.290
The president's serious today.

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:13.610
Blood-sucking Fire Wheel?

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:16.740
That has a nasty ring to it.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.330
Does Rokudou have a chance?

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:21.400
I'll accept your challenge, Rinne.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.340
But if you lose,

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:29.760
you're going to marry a Damashigami girl
and become heir to the company.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.970
Now the stakes are even.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.910
I'm not letting you free if you lose.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.970
The world isn't that kind.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:41.820
That seriously pisses me off, 
coming from someone swamped in debt.

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:43.030
Fine.

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:44.490
I accept.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:50.700
I'm saved.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.240
So many boxes of tissues.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:54.140
I'm going to take it to the living world.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.250
Rinne-sama will appreciate it, too.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:08.750
We bring you a battle between 
the current president

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:13.010
and the young president here at the 
Damashigami Company Banquet Hall!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:15.460
Don't let the company dissolve!

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.380
Go, President!

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:18.740
Rinne-sama!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.770
Marry me!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.650
Rokudou-kun.

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:25.920
Are you ready, Rinne?

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:26.900
Are you?

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.280
You better be prepared.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:34.530
Yay, I got New Year's gift money!

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:35.660
Boopsies.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.950
I'll hold on to this for you.

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:39.420
Leave it to Dad.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:44.430
Yay, I got entrance gift money!

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:45.550
Whoopsies.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:48.590
I'll buy you a backpack with this money.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:50.300
Leave it to Dad.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.810
Yay, we're having cake today!

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.060
Minesies.

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:59.690
I'll buy you the hugest cake ever!

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.650
Leave it to Dad!

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:05.360
Swiping a kid's money!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.970
Huh? Did that happen?

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.990
You're not getting away today.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.290
Here we go, untimed sudden death!

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:20.300
Blood-sucking Fire Wheel!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.590
What's this? He's opening with 
the Blood-sucking Fire Wheel!

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:26.170
I'll slice it in half!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.010
What?!

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:31.760
The scythe's gone!

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.840
5,000 yen, huh?

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.300
You're using a nice scythe.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:52.360
Blood-sucking Fire Wheel

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:52.360
<i>The Blood-sucking Fire Wheel instantly 
turns whatever it touches into money!</i>

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:55.380
<i>A vile Damashigami tool.</i>

00:07:56.490 --> 00:08:00.200
Next, I'll turn your Haori 
of the Underworld into money.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.120
It's coming this way!

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:11.470
How long can you keep running?

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:14.720
President! You better be 
giving that back later!

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.310
He looked away!

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:19.450
He seriously doesn't care to!

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:20.890
The president is at it again!

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.960
He's unwaveringly villainous!

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:24.780
Rokudou!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:26.660
Jumonji.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:29.230
I brought a bunch of plates 
and cutlery from the party.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.210
It's better than nothing, isn't it?

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:32.730
Thanks.

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:39.800
President, that's all company property.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.250
You better be giving that back.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.660
He looked away again!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.690
"What's mine is mine!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.780
What's the company's is also mine!"

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:49.670
Go, President!

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:51.760
Rokudou-kun isn't going to make it.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:55.870
Seal-san.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.130
Rokumon-chan.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:03.510
Um...

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:07.800
Sakura-sama.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.520
You have something wrapped around your neck.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.410
Is it paper?

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.410
Banquet Hall

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.410
President's
Room

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.410
A floor plan?

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:20.430
Is it telling us to go there?

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:27.480
What are you going to do throwing that at me?

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.490
It doesn't so much as tickle me.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:31.250
You're right.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:35.210
<i>I can't hurt him at this rate.</i>

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.580
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:37.880
Hello!

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:41.180
Meat

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:41.180
I'm hear for the Japanese Black payment!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:44.750
Oh, about that: could you 
put it on my son's tab?

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:45.580
That's it!

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:49.810
Oh, no. The young president left the field!

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:52.900
He's holding up the Japanese Black Beef!

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.070
What does he think he's doing?!

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:02.830
Thousand Winds Stream!

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:04.120
What?!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:06.160
<i>The Thousand Winds Stream</i>

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:09.880
<i>is a special attack in which one 
blasts bills on a gust of wind.</i>

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:11.540
Woo! Bring it in!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.960
Thank you, come again!

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:17.970
<i>He paid for it!</i>

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:20.750
President, hang in there!

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.690
This is bad!

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:26.220
He's so hurt he could cough up blood!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:27.880
I knew it.

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.720
He was totally intent on screwing him over,

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.200
so he's especially shocked.

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:33.980
Your dad seriously sucks.

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:38.890
Don't go thinking you've won yet, Rinne.

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:40.120
What?

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:44.080
You can never get away from your dad.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:50.000
I've hidden a forgery of your seal <i>somewhere</i>.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:55.530
As long as I have that, I can take as much 
money as I want from your savings account.

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:57.000
Not just that!

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.510
I can use it when I need 
a co-signor and stuff.

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:02.530
It's so handy-dandy!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.850
Um... Here?

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:14.270
Sakura-sama, look.

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:16.370
A safe.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:19.470
He wants us to open it.

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:25.730
Just who is that seal?

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:28.530
Sakura-sama, now, while we still can.

00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:29.620
Right.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.930
Nothing but invoices.

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:37.270
We really need the safe key.

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:39.260
I found it, Sakura-sama.

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.830
It was taped to the wall.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:42.580
Huh?

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.140
That's so careless.

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.140
Perfect.

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:50.040
Rokumon-chan, do you know the passcode?

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.970
I don't know.

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:54.860
I wonder if he carelessly left 
a memo somewhere or something.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:57.210
You!

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:59.230
What are you doing here?

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:01.670
Mrowrrr!

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:02.600
Monster!

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:03.650
Help me!

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:04.610
Sakura-sama!

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:06.090
Now your chance!

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:08.200
Open the safe!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.620
But how?

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:12.830
I don't even know where 
to look for the passcode.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:17.630
They say careless people tend to use 
their birthdays and phone numbers, but...

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:25.260
<i>You also should not use easily-guessed 
numbers like 1111 or 1234.</i>

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.260
<i>Never!</i>

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:30.760
I don't know anything about 
Rokudou-kun's father.

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:33.430
All I know is his name.

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:36.820
I doubt it, but...

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.470
Sa... ba... to.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:44.370
It opened.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:45.780
How careless!

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:48.900
Sakura-sama!

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.490
Are you okay?

00:12:58.340 --> 00:12:59.630
President!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.630
This is bad!

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:03.560
The safe in the president's 
office has been breached!

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:04.270
What?!

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:09.030
We have reports that the suspect 
is a human girl and a black cat.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.520
Mamiya Sakura and Rokumon!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.020
We have to stop them!

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:16.690
I won't let you!

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:23.530
You're not leaving the ring.

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:31.410
Now that the safe's been breached, 
I'll have to change tactics.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:33.450
Your tactics, you say?

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:39.900
Hurry to the President's office!

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:41.420
Damn it, catch them!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.290
Holy Ash!

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:48.300
I can't move!

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:51.140
I won't let you lay a finger on Mamiya-san!

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:54.980
Mamiya-san!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.340
I'm here to help you!

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:07.390
Ow.

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:10.490
Japanese Black Beef.

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:15.410
It's Rokudou-kun's scythe that his father

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.460
made disappear with the 
Blood-sucking Fire Wheel.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:19.210
Why is it here?

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:22.980
So the Blood-sucking Fire Wheel 
is connected to the safe.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:25.110
What else is there?

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:30.590
I need you to make yourself useful, Rinne.

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:32.510
You bastard.

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:47.350
What's the idea?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:50.260
Are you trying to take my handprint?

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:54.370
Yeah, the last time I took it was 
to celebrate when you were born.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:57.150
You've grown so big, Rinne.

00:14:57.150 --> 00:14:59.790
Let's stamp your hand!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:02.810
You just want my thumbmark 
to pay your debts, don't you?

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:10.170
<i>A thumbmark is made using ink 
on a thumb in place of seals.</i>

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:11.800
I'm  borrowing 500,000 yen in cash.
Rokudou Rinne

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.800
<i>They're also called tsumeins.</i>

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.620
<i>You'll be in deep trouble if you let someone</i>

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:18.420
<i>you don't trust talk you 
into making a thumbmark.</i>

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.560
I don't have time for this.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:23.060
I'm coming for you, Mamiya Sakura.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.520
Rokudou-kun.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:28.960
I got your shinigami scythe back.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.200
For free!

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:31.980
Mamiya Sakura.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:32.860
You're safe.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.180
Here.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:34.820
Right.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:38.600
Um, weren't you scared?

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:43.170
Nope, the security here's lax.
They're so careless, it was totally fine.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:45.950
Hey, what's up with that human girl?

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:47.240
She's too chummy.

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:50.050
She must be trying to take 
the president's wife's seat.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.170
How dare she?!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:54.070
Taking back your scythe won't help you.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:59.850
I'll keep sending it back to the safe 
with this here Blood-sucking Fire Wheel!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:02.520
Eh?

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.230
Seal-san.

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:21.910
What's this?

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:24.420
Marriage Registration

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:23.020
Huh?

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:24.420
Marriage registration?

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:28.240
We can't let a human girl take Rinne-sama!

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:31.090
Rinne-sama, stamp the marriage registration.

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:33.580
That's a good idea.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.170
I can get your handprint that way, too.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.220
With this!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.640
It's red ink!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.560
And then...

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:47.800
You put your hand on it, Rinne.

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:50.900
It's over now.

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:56.110
<i>Rokudou-kun.</i>

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:58.790
Rinne-sama put his handprint on it!

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:01.000
It's going to be me!

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.000
Yeah, right. It's going to be me!

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:07.880
Now, then, I'll announce 
his marriage partner.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.160
That's awful.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.200
How could you marry him off so randomly?

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.050
What's this?!

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:20.180
"I'm borrowing 5 million yen 
in cash -- Rokudou Rinne"

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:26.940
It's a loan form disguised 
as a marriage registration!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.560
You forged it.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:32.150
You're awful, President!

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:34.120
Take it more seriously!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.330
Let's do this ourselves.

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:37.710
Yeah.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:38.730
Let's go.

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:39.620
Oh, no.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:41.870
The ring's a mess!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.410
You can't take my handprint now, can you?

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:47.350
I lose.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.780
Sorry about everything.

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:52.250
Now, hit your dad.

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:56.760
Smack me right here.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.970
Here I go, then.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:02.180
No, Rinne-sama!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:05.080
He's trying to get your 
handprint on his face!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.020
Right!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:07.190
Don't, Rokudou-kun!

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:09.450
Don't run.

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:10.650
I can't hit you.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.480
Who hits his own dad with a closed fist?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:15.480
Slap me right here.

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:17.360
Right here, slap me!

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:21.330
Look.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:22.830
The mysterious Seal-san.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:32.710
You scum of the earth.

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:34.090
Grandma.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.210
Who's this old woman?

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:42.300
"Young lady," you mean!

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:49.050
It's over, Sabato.

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:50.480
Mother.

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:53.030
What? Is she the president's mother?

00:18:53.810 --> 00:19:00.070
Besides, Rinne is dating Mamiya 
Sakura, the human girl!

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:01.070
Eh?

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.920
It happened!

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.450
The lawless declaration of victory!

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:09.090
I knew it.

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:10.750
They're already dating.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.880
I had that feeling.

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.000
Mamiya-san.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.370
No way.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.670
<i>Wait, Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:20.350
<i>Doesn't this bother you?</i>

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:23.890
<i>I know it's just to get out of 
this situation, but </i>this<i> lie?</i>

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.210
<i>Tell me if it bothers you.</i>

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:29.830
<i>I can't get you caught up in this anymore.</i>

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.390
<i>What are you thinking?</i>

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:39.130
<i>I can't figure you out.</i>

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:47.390
Oh, really? You should have told me.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:48.950
Sorry I caused you so much grief.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.470
Now, let's shake hands to make up.

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:54.830
<i>Seriously.</i>

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:56.710
Why are you wearing that glove?!

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:59.240
He's trying to take your handprint again.

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.590
You scum of the earth!

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:05.050
Mrowrrr!

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:09.340
I got a new tatami mat, Rinne-sama!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:10.060
Yeah.

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:12.450
Sorry, Rinne.

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:17.520
I couldn't cancel your co-signor debt.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:21.280
I took cash from your dad's safe.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:24.540
I think there's enough to pay 
for the deposits he used up.

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:27.530
And your bank book and forged seal.

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:30.450
He can't withdraw your deposits anymore.

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:33.050
Here.

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:35.370
Right.

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:37.890
Sorry about everything, Mamiya Sakura.

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:42.170
Also, uh, about that thing...

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:45.130
Tamako-sama's amazing.

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:49.670
He shut up all those to-be brides 
with that spontaneous lie.

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:52.390
Is it?

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.610
It's a lie, I guess?

00:20:57.980 --> 00:20:58.920
It is, right?

00:20:58.920 --> 00:20:59.940
I knew it!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:05.820
<i>We have a letter of thanks 
from TJ-san from Tokyo.</i>

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:14.500
Scam

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:12.050
<i>Thanks to this relationship success 
pendant, I can trust her now.</i>

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:14.500
I recommend it to everyone!

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.730
What's wrong, Rokudou-kun?

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:20.760
N-Nothing.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:23.370
Yeah?

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:27.040
Oh, yeah. Rokumon-chan, how's your flu?

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:31.520
Oh, I feel better, 
now that I moved around a lot.

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:32.770
That's good.

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:42.880
<i>Meanwhile, Damashigami Company was closed 
due to an afterlife strain of influenza.</i>

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:44.400
Closed

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:44.400
Damashi

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:51.030
I also grabbed household goods and 
food and stuff amidst the chaos.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:53.660
We'll be worry-free for a while now.

00:21:54.740 --> 00:21:56.290
It's a lie, I guess?

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:01.640
<i>I guess it must have bothered her.</i>

00:22:06.310 --> 00:22:08.490
I'm so tired today.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:17.850
<i>But I'm glad Rokudou-kun didn't 
get forced into an engagement.</i>

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:21.980
<i>Yeah, I'm glad.</i>

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:26.020
Rinne-sama, do you still have the flu?

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:27.430
I don't know.

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:25.440
Next Episode:
 Ageha the Shinigami

00:24:01.320 --> 00:24:02.970
Rokumon's episode preview!

00:24:02.970 --> 00:24:04.620
Here's what's happening:

00:24:04.620 --> 00:24:06.620
What are you doing, Rokudou-kun?

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:08.210
No, Mamiya Sakura!

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:09.180
Who's that girl?

00:24:09.180 --> 00:24:11.130
No, it's uh, it just kind of happened.

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:12.880
No! Rokudou-kun, you suck!

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:16.010
This is a mistake, Mamiya Sakura!

00:24:14.880 --> 00:24:17.060
What are you going on about, Rokumon?

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:21.120
Ow, ow, I'm sorry, Rinne-sama.

00:24:22.010 --> 00:24:25.440
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: 
"Ageha the Shinigami."
